{"version":1,"content":"<p>道德安全研究員傑裏邁亞·福勒近日發現了一個龐大的未受保護數據庫，其中包含約20億條可能已泄露的賬户憑證。該數據庫似乎匯集了來自多起安全事件的多個憑證集合，在託管方決定阻止訪問之前，任何人都可以下載這些數據。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588234.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.954938+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:22:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_hash":"fa1bd2fc7f80741b5240486c3c5ea517021104a486ff0c3bf80fb0fe311b4f84","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}